    "claim": "Six scenes showed no failures at any setting tried: 096988dd, 0cf6368d, 0dbb91dd, 0e899dd3, 12855a41 and 19f339ba. Settings repeated several times keep upper bounds below 0.5, so these combinations are unlikely to fail often. On 0dbb91dd the retimed car never came close to the ego (criticality zero).",
